==History==
2016
*The Zap [[Cards|card]] was added with Clash Royale's game launch on 4/1/2016.
*On 9/2/2016, the [[Version History#Chest Rewards & Card Balance (9/2/2016)|Chest Rewards &amp; Card Balance Update]], increased the Zap's damage by 6%.
*On 19/2/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (19/2/2016)|Balance Update]], decreased the Zap’s [[:Category:Crown Towers|Crown Tower]] damage to 40% of the full damage (from 50%).
*On 29/2/2016, the [[Version History#March 2016 Update (29/2/2016)|March 2016 Update]], allowed the Zap to stun enemies for 1 second and decreased its damage by 6%. The update also changed the description. Previously, it used to say "Lightning zaps enemies, dealing damage inside a small radius. Reduced damage to Crown Towers.".
*On 3/5/2016, the [[Version History#May 2016 Update (3/5/2016)|May 2016 Update]], increased the {{Rarity|Common}} card Level cap to 13 (from 12).
*On 4/7/2016, the [[Version History#Tournaments Update (4/7/2016)|Tournaments Update]], allowed the Zap to stop the [[Elixir Collector]]'s [[Elixir]] generation and reset the [[Inferno Tower]]'s damage output.
*On 24/8/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (24/8/2016)|Balance Update]], decreased the Zap's stun duration to 0.5 seconds (from 1 second).
2017
*On 23/1/2017, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (23/1/2017)|Balance Update]], decreased the Zap’s damage by 6%.
*On 12/12/2017, the [[Version History#Electrifying Update (12/12/2017)|Electrifying Update]], decreased the Zap’s Crown Tower damage to 35% of the full damage (from 40%).
2018
*On 25/4/2018, the [[Version History#Clan%20Wars%20Update%20(25/4/2018)|Clan Wars Update]], allowed the Zap to be placed on the river.
*On 20/6/2018, the [[Version History#Summer%202018%20Update%20(20/6/2018)|Summer 2018 Update]], moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Zap from Spell Valley to P.E.K.K.A's Playhouse.
*On 3/9/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/9/2018)|Balance Update]], made it so that the Zap can no longer reset the attack of the [[Zappies]].
*On 1/10/2018, a [[Version History#October%20Balance%20Changes%20(1/10/2018)|Balance Update]], fixed a bug where [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]] that were spawned after their parent troops died would be immune to [[:Category:Spell Cards|spell]] damage.
2020
*On 4/8/2020, a [[Version History#Season 14 Balance Changes (4/8/2020)|Balance Update]], decreased the Zap's Crown Tower damage to 30% of the full damage (from 35%).
2021
*On 7/6/2021, the [[Version History#Summer%202021%20Update%20(7/6/2021)|Summer 2021 Update]], moved the Arena to unlock the Zap from P.E.K.K.A's Playhouse to Spell Valley.
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2022
*On 28/4/2022, a maintenance break, added a card render to the Zap's card info screen.
*On 26/10/2022, the [[Version History#2022%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(26/10/2022)|2022 Quarter 3 Update]], moved the Arena to unlock the Zap from Spell Valley to Builder's Workshop.
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
2024

*On 11/3/2024, the Zap's Evolution was added to the game.
2026

* On 1/6/2026, a Balance Update, decreased the Zap's Crown Tower damage to 25% of the full damage (from 30%)

